        <mxCell id="v57" value="&lt;b&gt;Privacy boundary (A11, FR-A-07, NFR-PR-01).&lt;/b&gt; Process 1.0 (red) is the only place locality is used, and it reads only the stored coarse outcome (D5: VERIFIED / INCONCLUSIVE / CONFLICTING). The device location is read once, in memory, when a member joins (UC-A3), outside this diagram. No flow or store here carries coordinates." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#8C99A6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1260" width="1000" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v58" value="&lt;b&gt;Balancing with level 0:&lt;/b&gt; DF-01 = DF-101; DF-02 = DF-123 + DF-132; DF-03 = DF-122; DF-04 = DF-04; DF-05 = DF-126B; DF-06 = DF-127; DF-07 = DF-128; DF-08 = DF-08. Every flow starts or ends at a process." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#8C99A6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1050" y="1260" width="1060" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
